    <!-- ========================================================
         SECTION 10: VERDICT
         ======================================================== -->
    <section class="content-section" id="section-verdict">
      <div class="section-label">Verdict</div>

      <p class="guide-prose">
        Serket is genuinely strong. Five simultaneous value layers from a single ultimate, a survivability system with two independent save cycles, and a board presence that punishes every enemy response. The hype is justified, but the context matters: she is a frontline bruiser-summoner that requires the right infrastructure to perform. Without energy-recovery support, her ultimate cycle stalls. Without meaningful relic investment -- especially Lv.3 -- her scorpion damage is modest.
      </p>

      <div class="verdict-tier-grid">
